PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786448896
OL,3,CWreck of warship discovered 118 years
OL,4,Cafter it sank off the Isle of Wight
OL,6,FA Royal Navy warship which sank 118
OL,7,Fyears ago, killing more than half of
OL,8,Fits crew, has been discovered by a
OL,9,Fgroup of divers off the Isle of Wight.
OL,11,FHMS Tiger sank in 1908 after it
OL,12,Fstrayed into the path of another
OL,13,Fwarship during a training exercise,
OL,14,Fand was sliced in two.
OL,16,FFewer than half of its 57-strong crew
OL,17,Fsurvived.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
