OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786448896
OL,3,CWreck of warship discovered 118 years
OL,4,Cafter it sank off the Isle of Wight
OL,6,FThe torpedo boat destroyer had no time
OL,7,Fto take evasive action to avoid
OL,8,Fcolliding with the cruiser HMS
OL,9,FBerwick, during night manoeuvres.
OL,11,FA Royal Navy spokesman said: "The
OL,12,Ftragedy made front page news, King
OL,13,FEdward VII sent a telegram of sympathy
OL,14,Fand commemorative postcards were
OL,15,Fproduced remembering the crew."
OL,26,@sD@^OUwD@_O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
