OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786448896
OL,3,CWreck of warship discovered 118 years
OL,4,Cafter it sank off the Isle of Wight
OL,6,FThe discovery of the wreck by the
OL,7,FProjectXplore group of divers and
OL,8,Fhistorians, which spent five years
OL,9,Fworking through the archives to
OL,10,Fpinpoint the Tiger's resting place,
OL,11,Fcomes as the Government is considering
OL,12,Fnew powers to protect military
OL,13,Fshipwrecks.
OL,15,FUnder the new Armed Forces Bill,
OL,16,Fmilitary shipwrecks would be
OL,17,Fsafeguarded with a "protected place"
OL,18,Fdesignation once the remains had been
OL,19,Ffound.
OL,26,@yD@TOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786448896
OL,3,CWreck of warship discovered 118 years
OL,4,Cafter it sank off the Isle of Wight
OL,6,FThe change in the law would expand
OL,7,Fexisting safeguards under the
OL,8,FProtection of Military Remains Act,
OL,9,Fwhich only cover vessels lost within
OL,10,Fthe past 200 years.
OL,12,FMinister for the Armed Forces Louise
OL,13,FSandher-Jones said: "As well as
OL,14,Fprotecting UK national security,
OL,15,Fdefence has a role to play in
OL,16,Fpreserving our maritime heritage and
OL,17,Fthe memory of those who gave their
OL,18,Flives serving their country.
OL,26,@uD@UOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786448896
OL,3,CWreck of warship discovered 118 years
OL,4,Cafter it sank off the Isle of Wight
OL,6,F"These protections go further to
OL,7,Fensure that these vulnerable and
OL,8,Fnationally significant monuments are
OL,9,Fprotected from day one of discovery,
OL,10,Fgiving lost sailors the dignity and
OL,11,Frespect they deserve.
OL,13,F"This Armed Forces Bill is wide-
OL,14,Franging in the measures it proposes `
OL,15,Ffrom protecting our rich cultural
OL,16,Fheritage, to transforming the lives of
OL,17,Fmilitary families by upgrading and
OL,18,Fimproving the defence housing estate."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786448896
OL,3,CWreck of warship discovered 118 years
OL,4,Cafter it sank off the Isle of Wight
OL,6,FLeo Fielding and Dan McMullen, co-
OL,7,Forganisers of ProjectXplore, said in a
OL,8,Fstatement: "It has been the privilege
OL,9,Fof a lifetime to research, discover
OL,10,Fand document the wreck of HMS Tiger.
OL,12,F"We sincerely hope that our work will
OL,13,Fensure that HMS Tiger, her story and
OL,14,Fthe memory of those connected with her
OL,15,Fendure for future generations.
OL,17,F"ProjectXplore welcomes the proposed
OL,18,Famendments in the Armed Forces Bill.
OL,26,@pD@LOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786448896
OL,3,CWreck of warship discovered 118 years
OL,4,Cafter it sank off the Isle of Wight
OL,6,F"We believe they represent a
OL,7,Fconstructive step forward in
OL,8,Fprotecting the United Kingdom's
OL,9,Fmaritime heritage and ensuring that
OL,10,Fwreck sites of historical and
OL,11,Farchaeological significance are
OL,12,Fappropriately safeguarded."
OL,14,FRoyal Navy Deputy Fleet Wreck Officer
OL,15,FLieutenant Commander Jen Smith said:
OL,16,F"Protecting military wrecks helps to
OL,17,Fensure they are preserved for future
OL,18,Fgenerations.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@[O]xD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786448896
OL,3,CWreck of warship discovered 118 years
OL,4,Cafter it sank off the Isle of Wight
OL,6,F"This is beneficial for our rich
OL,7,Fmaritime heritage and the diving
OL,8,Fcommunity who keep the stories of our
OL,9,Flost shipwrecks alive.
OL,11,F"Divers are still able to visit these
OL,12,Fsites and witness history first hand,
OL,13,Fwhich is key to ensuring that these
OL,14,Fships and their crews are not
OL,15,Fforgotten.
OL,17,F"All we ask of divers is this ` enjoy
OL,18,Flooking, learning and paying your
OL,19,Frespects at these incredible sites,
OL,20,Fbut do so in a manner that does not
OL,21,Fdisturb them."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUyD@AOU}D@NO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/8
